{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05317","headline":"奉和九月九日登慈恩寺浮图应制 · 张景源","name":"奉和九月九日登慈恩寺浮图应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"飞塔凌霄起，宸游一届焉。\n金壶新泛菊，宝座即披莲。\n就日摇香辇，凭云出梵天。\n祥氛与佳色，相伴杂鑪烟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张景源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05317.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05317","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}